This product is an unofficial community project for DeepSeek Harness.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by DeepSeek.

No third-party artwork, fonts, or media are included in this repository.
Sample skins under skins/demo/ are generated procedurally by tools in this
repository and are covered by the same license as the code.

Third-party dependencies are declared in each package.json and are installed
from the npm registry; they are not vendored here. Notable runtime dependencies:

  - sharp (Apache-2.0) — image resizing/encoding, used by the toolkit only
  - ffmpeg — invoked as an external program at runtime; it is never bundled.
    Users install it themselves (Gyan.FFmpeg or their platform package).

